[
  {
    "bg": "00003",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華、何か買っておきたい物はないか？\r\n飲み物とか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030070020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰は大丈夫。飲み物は事務所から持ってきたし、\r\n特に買いたい物はないよー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "準備万端だな。仕事にも慣れてきたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そう言われると、そうかもねー\r\nお仕事を前にテンパる三峰はもういないのだよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華は最初からテンパることも少なかっただろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、その自信は頼もしいよ\r\nきちんと仕事を積み重ねてきてる証拠だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーってば、三峰に期待してますな～\r\nだったら頑張るしかないね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん俺も応援するから──あ、降ってきたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00024",
    "se": "0125",
    "bgEffect": "fade"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……わ、本当だ！　やったぁ！\r\n雨降らないかなって思ってたんだよねー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bg": "00025",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020040",
    "bgEffect": "fade"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0144",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それ、この前の傘だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "その通り！　よく覚えててくれました！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれだけ楽しそうにしてたんだから忘れないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……ま、三峰の傘だもんね\r\nプロデューサーの印象に残るなんて軽い軽い",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "存分に働いてもらっちゃおうじゃん！",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱり機嫌良いな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そりゃね。ここ最近晴ればっかだったからさぁ\r\n傘使うの久しぶりなんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ていうかプロデューサーはささないの？\r\n濡れちゃうよ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだ小雨だし、これぐらいなら大丈夫かと思ったんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、そうだな\r\n確か、鞄に折りたたみ傘が……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0156",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あれ？　ない\r\n……しまった、事務所に忘れてきたみたいだ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……まったく、Ｐたん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "こっち、入りますー？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、いいよ\r\n入れてもらったら結華も濡れちゃうし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "濡れちゃダメなのはプロデューサーも一緒でしょー？\r\n風邪とかひいたらどうするの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020130"
  },
  {
    "select": "……じゃあ、\r\n入れてもらおうかな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "ありがとう、\r\n心配してくれて",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "大丈夫だから、\r\n俺のことは気にするな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもアイドルに体調管理を注意してるのに、\r\n俺が風邪ひいたらダメだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "物わかりが良いねＰたん！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰のプロデューサーは、\r\nプロデューサーしかいないんだから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰のためにも、体、ちゃんと大事にしてよー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、悪かった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "担当アイドルから注意されてたんじゃ、\r\nプロデューサーとして、俺もまだまだだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそう、Ｐたんは仕事にかまけて\r\n自分のこと後回しにしがちだからね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰の心配だけじゃなくて、自分の心配もしてくれないと！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ありがとうな",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華の言う通り、\r\nこれからは気をつけるようにするよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華のおかげで、風邪ひかなくて済みそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なんなら、三峰にお礼してくれてもいいよー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうだな。何がいい？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えっ、やだな冗談だよ！\r\n傘ぐらいいつでも貸すってば！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だろうなぁ。そう思ったから俺も冗談で返したんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "！　……もー、そういうことするよねーＰたんって！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そんなこと言ってると、Ｐたんがちょうど濡れるように\r\n傘の位置変えちゃうんだから",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それは困るな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも本当にありがとう\r\n次からは結華に迷惑かけないようにするから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……わかってなーい\r\n三峰にとってはこんなの、迷惑でもなんでもありませーん",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……頼ってもらっていいんだから。……ね？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020250,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まったくもう！　頑固すぎ！\r\nほら、入って入って！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うわっ\r\nそんな、腕を引っ張らなくても……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "こうでもしないとずっと遠慮したままの人に\r\n言われたくないでーす",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……悪いな\r\n俺がうっかりしたばっかりに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "全然？　三峰むしろ楽しいし",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　なんでだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えー？　それ三峰に言わせるの～？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……相合傘だからに決まってるじゃん",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえばそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "反応薄っ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020310,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ちょっと、プロデューサー！　もっとなんかないのー？\r\nここ、少女漫画だったらときめく場面なんだけど！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言われてもな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰相手じゃドキドキしないってわけ～？\r\nこの贅沢者～！！",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020330,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はぁ……。プロデューサーに少女漫画的展開を\r\n期待したのが悪かったかぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005020340,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そのうち見てろよー、鈍感Ｐくんめ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700502/2007005020340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
